# DMD is CC BY-NC-ND: annotation derived split manifests are not redistributed.
# Regenerate them deterministically with the documented build command (seed 0).
/splits/dmd-distraction/
/splits/dmd-gaze/
/splits/yawdd/
*.npy
*.mp4
*.avi
*.mov
